### ============================================
### NOTES
### ============================================
# 1. Replace YOUR_TOKEN_HERE with actual JWT token from login endpoint
# 2. Replace numeric IDs with actual resource IDs
# 3. Dates should be in ISO 8601 format (YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SSZ)
# 4. Use @variable syntax to store tokens for reuse across requests
# 5. Manager role required for restaurant operations
# 6. Chef role required for kitchen operations
# 7. Customer role required for order and reservation operations
